---
import { sections } from '../data/project';
const security = sections.security;
---
<section class="one-section shell" id="security" aria-labelledby="security-heading"><header><p class="eyebrow">{security.eyebrow}</p><h2 id="security-heading">{security.title}</h2><p class="lede">{security.intro}</p></header><div class="blocks">{security.blocks.map(([title, detail], index) => <article><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{detail}</p></article>)}</div><p class="boundary">Runtime-impact testing and retirement rules are documented in <a href="#runtime-runtime-maintenance">R–03 above</a>; this section owns reporting, release evidence, and incident response.</p></section>
<style>.one-section{padding-block:4rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}header{max-width:850px}.blocks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);margin-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-left:1px solid var(--line)}article{padding:1rem;border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}article>span{color:var(--violet);font:.6rem var(--mono)}article h3{margin:.8rem 0 .4rem;font:600 .78rem/1.3 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}article p,.boundary{color:var(--muted)}article p{margin:0;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.55}.boundary{max-width:850px;margin-top:2rem;font-size:.9rem}.boundary a{color:var(--ink)}@media(max-width:760px){.blocks{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
